 arch\, Promotion\, Consumer Education and Industry Information Order (Orde
 r). The changes include clarifying the assessment rate for softwood lumber
  imported into the United States and revising the membership of the Softwo
 od Lumber Board (Board or SLB).\nhttps://www.federalregister.gov/documents
 /2026/09/22/2026-19389/softwood-lumber-board-assessment-rate-clarification
 -and-changes-to-membership
